// Realistic Moon
Verts: 2.031.618 // Faces: 2.031.616 // Tris: 4.063.232
Software: Blender v2.80.75

AirPatrol allows you to control your home heating and cooling from your smartphone.This design aims to Smaller and simpler and the same time Ensuring the Beautiful/High end look.Smaller in area and correct place of Infrared sensor placing make it more sensitive and attractive in wall. Also there in front panel both of Humidity and Temperature sensor make it look so Good.down side of Temperature and humidity sensor, i placed the button hole to make it access so faster and easy way as like all user want.Wi-Fi symbol is there not only for the Eye catching but also for placing the Wi-fi Antenna inside, I made the wifi symbol there for better appearance.The two IR's Sensor is well placed for better coverage.One is in the bottom at the angle of15-18 degree to take reading so fast and in easier way. And second one i placed front of the Air-patrol face.Dimension are within the limit (Not so Big), Inner side enough space to fit the motherboard (76X76).I Made the place hole to fasten both the halves with simple 2-3mm diameter screw, which make it so comfortable to open the box for replacing the motherboard if need.And also back side having a place to mount the Air-patrol box on the wall.This model suits the Air-patrol brand because of its design giving symbol of good relationship between the company and user also Design sets the all requirement for better performance as always the company promise of.Here is the Challenge page:-"https://grabcad.com/challenges/airpatrol-controller-casing-design-challenge"Modified version:-  Heart removed, and case is perfect square, Extra LED's Indicator Defined, according to its mode of use.
Update 2:- Slimmer Design uploaded, and also the dimension are able to modify according to needs of motherboard spec from the Air-patrol team.
//Thanks//

